                                        "entry_id": "5f68493c-0707-355b-ae7e-eb53de66725d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The stalk supporting an inflorescence or a solitary flower/fruit."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "40313b60-f696-315d-9d5d-e483f56a53b0",
                                        "entry_id": "5f68493c-0707-355b-ae7e-eb53de66725d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A short stalk at the base of a reproductive structure of a non-flowering plant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9efb9cb4-cfff-474a-b6a9-25f16aa2bdb9",
                                                "sense_id": "40313b60-f696-315d-9d5d-e483f56a53b0",
                                                "text": "On fertilization, the archegonia form obyriform calyptrae that are distinctly narrowed at base to form a stalk or peduncle; this does not occur in other Hepaticae."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "75d7385b-99b1-340c-8357-22b05e6a50e0",
                                        "entry_id": "5f68493c-0707-355b-ae7e-eb53de66725d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A bundle of neurons connecting different parts of the brain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bac52eac-08e5-39b9-aa5c-a6a332bc987e",
                                        "entry_id": "5f68493c-0707-355b-ae7e-eb53de66725d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In arthropods, the base segments of an antenna or stalk-like structures such as the peduncles of some barnacles"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3302c53f-9753-30cf-ad61-eab898f37f8a",
                                        "entry_id": "5f68493c-0707-355b-ae7e-eb53de66725d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In vertebrates, the base of any relatively massive anatomical member connected to the body by a narrower section. Cf. caudal peduncle of fishes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a7fd58f7-37b8-3f4b-8a09-26220cf42f7a",
                                        "entry_id": "5f68493c-0707-355b-ae7e-eb53de66725d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A stem attaching a mass of tissue (such as a polyp) to the body."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "307bd5b9-e286-31fe-aece-ef7eff409602",
                                        "entry_id": "5f68493c-0707-355b-ae7e-eb53de66725d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A collection of nerves in the appendage of an animal (such as the tip of a dolphin's tail)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
